notes.content:
Hi everyone, and thank you for playing EvilVEvil!

We have pushed a new patch today focused towards fixing crashes, improving stability and some overall tweaks.

Tech & Stability:

 Fixed an issue which didn't allow to accept invitations for joining someone's lobby;
 Players, who has never participated your lobby, no more able to join you if a match has already started;

QoL things:

 Difficulty Panel in the Quick Game context menu has been disabled by default to prevent an issue when players weren't able to find someone else;
